Full contract: [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md). Every rule lives there; this file
only points at it. `AGENTS.md` wins on any conflict.

**Quick reference** (headlines only — the text in AGENTS.md is the rule)
- Spec first: no implementation before a confirmed spec in `docs/src/specifications/`
- Tests second: the spec's business tests become executable tests before the code
- Update the spec in the same PR when the implementation settles differently
- Never commit to `main` — branch, PR, review
- Never edit a released Liquibase changeset — append one
- Controller → service → repository; errors as `application/problem+json`; identifiers are strings
- Before a PR: `./gradlew test`, `npx tsc -b`, `scripts/check-changesets`, and the flow in the browser
